{#
| Variable              | Type      | Description                                        |
|-----------------------|-----------|----------------------------------------------------|
| component             | object    | merchant settings from twilight.json               |
| component.heading     | string    | the small navy line above the product name; empty hides it |
| component.show_section_head | bool | the centred section heading over the card (default on; never saved reads as on) |
| component.section_title | string  | that heading (empty → «اختيار عملاء قصة»)              |
| component.subheading  | string    | the line under that heading; empty hides it        |
| component.products    | Product[] | featured product (the FIRST selected is used)      |
| component.show_marquee| bool      | show/hide the «الأكثر مبيعًا» ribbon               |
| component.marquee_text| string    | ribbon label (default «الأكثر مبيعًا»)             |
| component.new_card_design | bool  | the Oct 2026 card (default on; never saved reads as on)  |
| component.inside_title | string   | new card: the line over the contents (never saved → «تتضمن الآتي:», empty hides it) |
| position              | int       | sorting block                                      |

Product Hero — Figma "Qusah Re-Vamp": desktop 592:973, mobile 591:732.
One featured product in the shared Product Hero card (partials/qpack-card):
gallery on the right, details on the left; on phones the heading and price,
then the gallery, then the rest.
#}
{% set product = component.products|first %}
{# The section heading (Ghaida's note, Oct 2026): the product gets a heading of its own, in the same style as every
   other home section (.qprods__head), so it no longer reads as part of the banner above it #}
{% set show_head = not (component.show_section_head is not null and not component.show_section_head) %}
{% set section_title = component.section_title|default(trans('blocks.qissa.package_heading')) %}
{# new_card_design (default on; never saved reads as on): the Oct 2026 card, Figma 723:761 / 721:620 #}
{% set card_v2 = not (component.new_card_design is not null and not component.new_card_design) %}
<section class="s-block qpack{{ show_head ? ' qpack--headed' : '' }}" id="qpack-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">
        {% if product and show_head %}
            <div class="qprods__head qpack__head">
                <h2 class="qprods__title">{{ section_title }}</h2>
                {% if component.subheading %}
                    <p class="qprods__subtitle">{{ component.subheading }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if product %}
            {% include 'components.partials.qpack-card' with {
                product: product,
                eyebrow: component.heading,
                ribbon: component.show_marquee ? component.marquee_text|default(trans('blocks.qissa.best_seller')) : false,
                look: card_v2 ? 'v2' : '',
                inside_title: component.inside_title is null ? trans('blocks.qissa.inside_title') : component.inside_title
            } %}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
